{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55716","headline":"涵虚沼留题 · 钱昱","name":"涵虚沼留题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"景致逼神仙，心幽道亦[玄]（元）。\n僧闲来出世，松老不知年。\n放马眠岩草，移盃酌涧泉。\n浮名如脱得，终老此云边。\n（见影印文渊阁《四库全书》本《福建通志》卷七七。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55716.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55716","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}